<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>
  /* 视觉标准 = eval/bench/docs/report-design.md（改风格先改文档） */
  body { margin:0; font-family: system-ui,-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;
         background:#0A0D0F; color:#C9D1D5;
         background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px);
         background-size: 40px 40px; }
  .wrap { width:1080px; box-sizing:border-box; padding:56px 48px 44px; }
  .kicker { margin:0; font-family:'SF Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:4px; color:#5EEAD4; }
  h1 { margin:14px 0 0; font-size:30px; font-weight:800; color:#F5F7F8; }
  .sub { margin:8px 0 0; color:#8A949C; font-size:15px; }
  .decl { margin-top:40px; padding:18px 22px; background:#14171C; border:1px solid #2A3138;
          border-left:4px solid #F472B6; border-radius:10px; font-size:13px; line-height:1.9;
          color:#C9D1D5; white-space:pre-line; }
  .foot { margin-top:32px; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
          display:flex; justify-content:space-between;
          font-family:'SF Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace; font-size:13px; color:#5C6670; }
</style></head><body><div class="wrap">
<p class="kicker">MODEL QUICK EVAL · SHEET</p>
<h1>{{title}}</h1>
<p class="sub">纯 prompt vs + Ddo-Code-Flow · 同模型 A/B · 规格达标率见每题标注</p>
{{grid}}
<div class="decl">{{declarations}}</div>
<div class="foot"><span>{{brand}}</span><span>{{roundTag}}</span></div>
</div></body></html>
